          "end": 32.96,
          "type": "spacing",
          "speakerId": "speaker_1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Technologiesという会社の共同創業者兼CEOを務めております。Kotoba",
          "start": 32.96,
          "end": 38.58,
          "type": "word",
          "speakerId": "speaker_1"
